{"id":"e81a88fc44254236","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-zero-l-system.md","title":"0L 系统与并行改写语言","display":"df-zero-l-system — 0L 系统与并行改写语言","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-zero-l-system","aliases":["73-df-zero-l-system"],"display":"df-zero-l-system — 0L 系统与并行改写语言","depends_on":["[[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]","[[73-df-finite-path-closure]]"],"source_id":"HU1979","source_ref":"§14.4, p. 391; scan 399","source_status":"book-based-local-formalization","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","legacy_source_id":"HU1979","legacy_source_ref":"§14.4, p. 391; scan 399","legacy_source_status":"book-based-local-formalization","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"outside-third-edition","third_edition_relation":"新版之外的拓展；保留真实旧版或独立文献来源，不归入第三版正文。"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-zero-l-system"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-zero-l-system</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zero-l-system — 0L 系统与并行改写语言"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0a6da8c909717780\" href=\"?note=0a6da8c909717780\" title=\"73-df-finite-words-and-languages\">73-df-finite-words-and-languages</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"25902d0bd75ea963\" href=\"?note=25902d0bd75ea963\" title=\"73-df-finite-path-closure\">73-df-finite-path-closure</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HU1979"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§14.4, p. 391; scan 399"},{"key":"source_status","html":"book-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"legacy_source_id","html":"HU1979"},{"key":"legacy_source_ref","html":"§14.4, p. 391; scan 399"},{"key":"legacy_source_status","html":"book-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"outside-third-edition"},{"key":"third_edition_relation","html":"新版之外的拓展；保留真实旧版或独立文献来源，不归入第三版正文。"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 为候选三元组；结构定义后固定有效 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G=(\\Sigma,P,\\omega)\">\\(G=(\\Sigma,P,\\omega)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y\\in\\Sigma^*\">\\(x,y\\in\\Sigma^*\\)</span>。有限序列和有限步闭包见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0a6da8c909717780\" href=\"?note=0a6da8c909717780\" title=\"73-df-finite-words-and-languages\">73-df-finite-words-and-languages</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"25902d0bd75ea963\" href=\"?note=25902d0bd75ea963\" title=\"73-df-finite-path-closure\">73-df-finite-path-closure</a>。产生式集取有限表示；不另要求每个字符都有规则。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zero\\text{-}l\\text{-}system}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{OL}_{\\Sigma}(G)\\leftrightarrow\\exists P,\\omega\\;[G=(\\Sigma,P,\\omega)\\land P\\subseteq\\Sigma\\times\\Sigma^*\\land|P|&lt;\\aleph_0\\land\\omega\\in\\Sigma^+]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zero\\text{-}l\\text{-}system}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{OL}_{\\Sigma}(G)\\leftrightarrow\\exists P,\\omega\\;[G=(\\Sigma,P,\\omega)\\land P\\subseteq\\Sigma\\times\\Sigma^*\\land|P|&lt;\\aleph_0\\land\\omega\\in\\Sigma^+]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zero\\text{-}l\\text{-}system}\\vdash\nx\\Rightarrow^{0L}_Gy\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\mathbf u\\in(\\Sigma^*)^{|x|}\\;[y=\\operatorname{Concat}_{\\Sigma}(\\mathbf u)\\land\\forall i\\in\\{0,\\ldots,|x|-1\\}\\;(x(i),\\mathbf u(i))\\in P]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zero\\text{-}l\\text{-}system}\\vdash\nx\\Rightarrow^{0L}_Gy\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\mathbf u\\in(\\Sigma^*)^{|x|}\\;[y=\\operatorname{Concat}_{\\Sigma}(\\mathbf u)\\land\\forall i\\in\\{0,\\ldots,|x|-1\\}\\;(x(i),\\mathbf u(i))\\in P]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zero\\text{-}l\\text{-}system}\\vdash\nR^{0L}_G\\coloneqq\\{(x,y)\\in(\\Sigma^*)^2:x\\Rightarrow^{0L}_Gy\\},\\qquad L(G)\\coloneqq\\{w\\in\\Sigma^*:(\\omega,w)\\in\\operatorname{RTC}_{\\Sigma^*}(R^{0L}_G)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zero\\text{-}l\\text{-}system}\\vdash\nR^{0L}_G\\coloneqq\\{(x,y)\\in(\\Sigma^*)^2:x\\Rightarrow^{0L}_Gy\\},\\qquad L(G)\\coloneqq\\{w\\in\\Sigma^*:(\\omega,w)\\in\\operatorname{RTC}_{\\Sigma^*}(R^{0L}_G)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zero\\text{-}l\\text{-}system}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{OLang}_{\\Sigma}\\coloneqq\\{L(G):\\operatorname{OL}_{\\Sigma}(G)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zero\\text{-}l\\text{-}system}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{OLang}_{\\Sigma}\\coloneqq\\{L(G):\\operatorname{OL}_{\\Sigma}(G)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p><strong>版本归属：新版之外的拓展。</strong> 本条不作为所提供第三版 PDF 的正文陈述；原始来源以 source_id/source_ref 为准。</p>\n<p>每步必须同时替换所有出现位置；同一字符的不同出现可独立选择规则。没有适用规则的位置会阻断这一步。开始词按原书要求非空；允许空右部，所以语言仍可能含 ε。扫描 p.391 已确认这些区别。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-finite-words-and-languages","status":"resolved","id":"0a6da8c909717780","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-path-closure","status":"resolved","id":"25902d0bd75ea963","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-finite-path-closure]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-words-and-languages","status":"resolved","id":"0a6da8c909717780","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)$，$G$ 为候选三元组；结构定义后固定有效 $G=(\\Sigma,P,\\omega)$，$x,y\\in\\Sigma^*$。有限序列和有限步闭包见 [[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]、[[73-df-finite-path-closure]]。产生式集取有限表示；不另要求每个字符都有规则。","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-path-closure","status":"resolved","id":"25902d0bd75ea963","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)$，$G$ 为候选三元组；结构定义后固定有效 $G=(\\Sigma,P,\\omega)$，$x,y\\in\\Sigma^*$。有限序列和有限步闭包见 [[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]、[[73-df-finite-path-closure]]。产生式集取有限表示；不另要求每个字符都有规则。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"G=(\\Sigma,P,\\omega)","display":false},{"tex":"x,y\\in\\Sigma^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zero\\text{-}l\\text{-}system}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{OL}_{\\Sigma}(G)\\leftrightarrow\\exists P,\\omega\\;[G=(\\Sigma,P,\\omega)\\land P\\subseteq\\Sigma\\times\\Sigma^*\\land|P|<\\aleph_0\\land\\omega\\in\\Sigma^+]","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zero\\text{-}l\\text{-}system}\\vdash\nx\\Rightarrow^{0L}_Gy\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\mathbf u\\in(\\Sigma^*)^{|x|}\\;[y=\\operatorname{Concat}_{\\Sigma}(\\mathbf u)\\land\\forall i\\in\\{0,\\ldots,|x|-1\\}\\;(x(i),\\mathbf u(i))\\in P]","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zero\\text{-}l\\text{-}system}\\vdash\nR^{0L}_G\\coloneqq\\{(x,y)\\in(\\Sigma^*)^2:x\\Rightarrow^{0L}_Gy\\},\\qquad L(G)\\coloneqq\\{w\\in\\Sigma^*:(\\omega,w)\\in\\operatorname{RTC}_{\\Sigma^*}(R^{0L}_G)\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zero\\text{-}l\\text{-}system}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{OLang}_{\\Sigma}\\coloneqq\\{L(G):\\operatorname{OL}_{\\Sigma}(G)\\}","display":true}],"bytes":2426,"backlinks":[{"id":"d8c56a770dbde9c3","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"固定 $G=(\\Sigma,P,\\omega)$ 满足 $\\operatorname{OL}_{\\Sigma}(G)$，见 [[73-df-zero-l-system]]。$f:\\Sigma\\to\\Sigma^*$，同态扩张 $\\widehat f$ 见 [[73-df-word-homomorphism]]；$n\\in\\mathbb N,w\\in\\Sigma^*$。"},{"id":"5a0a940e7dd346c9","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{a\\}$ 为单字符字母表。0L 语言见 [[73-df-zero-l-system]]，CFL 泵引理见 [[73-thm-cfg-pumping-bound]]。"},{"id":"4999c67bb24a8b0d","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{a\\}$ 为字母表，$\\mathsf{OLang}_{\\Sigma}$ 见 [[73-df-zero-l-system]]。单元素词语言在集合构造中显式使用单字符词。"},{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-352","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-df-zero-l-system|0L 系统与并行改写语言]]"},{"id":"7552cf9d94a12108","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)$。0L 和指标语言类分别见 [[73-df-zero-l-system]]、[[73-df-indexed-language]]。"}],"outgoing":["0a6da8c909717780","25902d0bd75ea963"]}